        "name": "Relevant Events",
        "summary": "Career-event pipeline, 1 row per event. Kanban grouped by `status` (Lead → Interested → Registered → Attended); all new rows = Lead. `relevance` (0-100) scores networking value, topic fit, format/location fit and organizer prestige against events-profile.md; `tier` = strong/worth/skip. Fields: name, type, organizer, topic, location, format, date, closing (registration deadline), cost, relevance, tier, status, why, source, url. type=`Location` is a standing hangout venue with no date, exempt from the date gate and never pushed to the calendar. Populated by /find-events, which fans out event-scout subagents per source bucket in sources.md `## Event sources`. Event dates and registration deadlines link into the Deadlines calendar."
